## Get index of rows

To get the index positions of rows where the name "Aria" appears, use the Polars expression `arg_true` like this:

::: {#84f9a8c9 .cell execution_count=2}
``` {.python .cell-code}
(df
 .select((pl.col('Student') == 'Aria').arg_true())
 )
```

